---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — KurtMorales" description="KurtMorales privacy policy.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="pt-32 pb-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <span class="text-gray-400 font-bold text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase block mb-6">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-medium text-brand mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-16">Last updated: May 2026</p>
      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-brand prose-headings:font-medium prose-a:text-brand">
        <p>At KurtMorales, your privacy is fundamental. This policy outlines how we handle any information collected during our digital design engagements.</p>
        <h2>01. Data Collection</h2>
        <p>We only collect data voluntarily provided via contact forms — specifically your name, email address, and project details — to facilitate business communication. We do not use tracking pixels, session recording tools, or behavioral analytics.</p>
        <h2>02. Information Usage</h2>
        <p>Data collected is used exclusively for project coordination and follow-up communication. We do not sell, rent, or transmit your information to third-party data brokers, advertising networks, or marketing services.</p>
        <h2>03. Data Storage</h2>
        <p>Contact form submissions are handled via Cloudflare Pages infrastructure and optionally forwarded via email. We do not maintain a persistent database of contact inquiries beyond what is necessary for active project communication.</p>
        <h2>04. Cookies</h2>
        <p>This website does not use tracking cookies. No third-party analytics tools are loaded. Font resources are loaded from Google Fonts, which may set performance-related cookies subject to Google's own privacy policy.</p>
        <h2>05. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to request deletion of any data you've submitted. To do so, contact us at <a href="mailto:email@kurtmorales.com">email@kurtmorales.com</a>.</p>
        <h2>06. Changes</h2>
        <p>This policy may be updated periodically. Continued use of this site constitutes acceptance of any revised terms.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions? Reach out at <a href="mailto:email@kurtmorales.com">email@kurtmorales.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
